OL,3,AFive men arrested in RAF Fairford
OL,4,Aincident released on police bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe five men are all UK nationals in
OL,7,Ftheir 20s from London.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
