OL,3,AUK tries to stop Trump's diesel export
OL,4,Aban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK is in talks with US authorities
OL,7,Fover a potential stoppage of diesel
OL,8,Fexports and has started preparing for a
OL,9,Fban, Chancellor John Healey has told
OL,10,FBBC News.
OL,12,FDiesel prices in the UK reached a new
OL,13,Fhigh on Monday due to supply pressures
OL,14,Fspringing from the US-Israel conflict
OL,15,Fwith Iran and Russia's war with
OL,16,FUkraine.
OL,18,FFuel prices are rising globally and US
OL,19,FPresident Donald Trump has threatened
OL,20,Fto ban diesel exports, stating at the
OL,21,Fweekend: "We're thinking about it very
OL,22,Fseriously."
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
