OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATwelve women have been killed in one
OL,4,Apart of South Africa since July. Here's
OL,5,Awhat we know so far
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice in South Africa have confirmed
OL,8,Fthe discovery of the bodies of three
OL,9,Fmore women in an area east of
OL,10,FJohannesburg, bringing the total number
OL,11,Fof bodies found there to 12 in just two
OL,12,Fmonths.
OL,14,FThe latest bodies were found in
OL,15,FEkurhuleni between Saturday and Monday
OL,16,Fmorning, according to local police.
OL,18,FPolice have made arrests in three of
OL,19,Fthe cases, which do not appear to be
OL,20,Frelated to the others. Nevertheless,
OL,21,Fpolice have said they cannot rule out
OL,22,Fthe possibility of a serial killer.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
