OL,3,ATwelve women have been killed in one
OL,4,Apart of South Africa since July. Here's
OL,5,Awhat we know so far
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe discoveries have caused widespread
OL,8,Falarm in Ekurhuleni, particularly
OL,9,Faround Kempton Park, and come against
OL,10,Fthe backdrop of longstanding concerns
OL,11,Fabout high levels of violence against
OL,12,Fwomen in South Africa.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
