OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFrench PM warns against escalation of
OL,4,Aschool protests after 164 arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FLecornu cited reported incidents at
OL,7,Fprotests in a post on X, saying:
OL,8,F"Fireworks, fires, violence near high
OL,9,Fschools: nothing justifies endangering
OL,10,Fstudents, staff, or police officers."
OL,12,FBut a French union that defends the
OL,13,Finterests of high school students said
OL,14,Fthe protests were a "legitimate
OL,15,Fresponse" to the conditions they face.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
